{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三教、鍾馗氏、鬼神附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三教、鍾馗氏、鬼神附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐朝名畫錄作土火羅國，歷代名畫記作于闐國人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作求"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四庫提要云迄智海，偶誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中國人名大辭典"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳氏寶顏堂秘笈本，用百川學海本校。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子溫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "匾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會昌中多毀折，今亦具戰，亦有好事收得畫壁在人家者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殿內絹上寫玄元真是吳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天后飛白書額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按裴錄云，此寺有劉焉畫，恐是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殷仲容題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與裴緣同，據裴畫錄亦有鄭畫，今不見也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據西京記合有鄭畫，今亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據裴畫錄。此寺有孫尚子畫，今不見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王什、杜懷亮書，人罕知，有書迹甚高，似鍾書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在安定坊，會昌中毀寺後，却置不改舊額。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "毀寺後有僧收得，再置却懸之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弘福寺沙\n門懷仁集王右軍書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顏魯公書，徐浩題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙門飛錫撰，吳通微書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "額高力士書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊惠之書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子壽王主簿韓幹敬貌遺法，弟子沙門飛錫撰頌并書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盧稜伽、韓幹畫裏面，吳生畫時菩薩現，吳生貌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相傳云是楊廷光畫，畫時筆端舍利從空而落"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙門懷案草書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "韓幹正畫，細小稠閻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顏魯公書，岑勛撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張芬書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳通微書，僧道秀撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "木匠李伏橫，石作張愛兒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "李陽冰，石作張愛兒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "面東碑韓釋木八分書，王據撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張芬書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殿內有李綸畫普賢菩薩，田琳畫文殊師利菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武后題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殷仲容題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王羲之題額，從荊州將來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從上元縣移來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄宗朝南薰殿學士劉子臯書額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與裴孝源錄同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "展畫與裴錄同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殷仲容題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殷仲容題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歐陽詢題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據裴錄，此寺亦有展畫，其田、楊、鄭並同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩寺並殷令名題額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴孝源畫錄云，有陳郎見畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴孝源云，自孫尚子畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴錄云，有曹仲達、李雅、楊契丹、鄭法士畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴錄云，有鄭法士畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴錄云，有鄭法士、李雅畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "係本寺三階院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從江南將來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據裴孝源畫錄云，有孫尚子畫，彥遠按：敬愛寺是中宗皇帝為高宗武后置，孫尚子是隋朝畫乎，裴君所記為謬矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "巧兒張壽宋朝塑，王玄策指揮，李安貼金"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張智藏塑，即張壽之弟也。陳永承成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竇弘果塑，已上三處像光及化生等，並是劉爽刻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竇弘果塑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趙震贊塑，今謂之聖神也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並竇弘果塑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上並是竇弘果塑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劉行臣描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並劉行臣描，趙龕成自餘並聖曆已後劉茂德、皇甫節共成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劉茂德成，即行臣子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趙武端描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劉阿祖描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張法受描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "何長壽描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張法受描趙龕成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並神龍後王韶應描董忠成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開元十年吳道子描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳道子描。翟琰成。罪福報應，是雜手成，所以色損也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武靜藏描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蘇思忠描，陳慶子成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武靜藏描，陳慶子成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開元三年史小淨起樣，隨隱起等是張阿乾，生銅作并蠟樣是李正、王\n\n兼亮、郭兼子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高五尺五寸，闊四尺，重二千斤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "毛婆羅樣後更加木座及須彌山浮趺等，高一丈二尺，張阿乾蠟樣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長一丈二尺，張李\n八寫并成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金銅脚長一丈二尺，張李八寫并成，又四口亦長一丈二尺，雜手成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並趙武端描，惟唐三藏是劉行臣描亦成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師奴描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並劉行臣描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並趙武端描，或云劉行臣描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並聖曆已後劉茂德描，陳庶子成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並劉行臣描"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖曆後有神英法師，令何長壽掃却，欲重描。神英京兆黨何生，洛下眾僧黨劉行臣。時人以何生雖善山水，至於畫神不如劉。劉為關東獨步，與西京長壽齊名，洛下之意，抑\n何進劉，不許神英之請，還遣行臣之子茂德續其父畫，今中門東神及兩鬼腰已上新接者，亦不逮其父矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彥遠遊西\n京寺觀不得遍，惟敬愛寺得細探討，故為詳備。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴孝源云，有董伯仁畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裴云，有展畫，今不見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顧畫維摩詰，初置甘露寺中，後為虞尚書簡辭所取，寶於家以匣之。大中七年，今上因訪宰臣，此畫，遂詔壽州刺史盧簡辭求以進，賜之金帛，以畫示百官後，收入內。"}
